<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
    Expanded home header artwork.

    Deep-green ground, a khatam (eight-point star) lattice fading out across the
    left, and an emerald sweep in the lower right traced by a gold hairline —
    the banner treatment, recomposed for the header's proportions rather than a
    wide strip. The viewport is deliberately close to the expanded header's
    aspect so centerCrop trims almost nothing at rest; as the header collapses
    the art zooms slightly instead of squashing, and fades out anyway.

    The collapsed header drops this and keeps only bg_home_header's flat
    gradient underneath.
-->
